Hyperspace by Mårten Rånge (mrange)
https://github.com/mrange/synesthesia-public/tree/main/hyperspace.synScene

Ported to Metal Shading Language for MacOS Live Wallpaper; see the note at the
top of main.metal for what was changed.

Where the licence is stated

The repository this scene was written for, mrange/synesthesia-public, has a
LICENSE file in its root:
https://github.com/mrange/synesthesia-public/blob/main/LICENSE
It was added in the repository's first commit (2025-09-13), before this scene
(2026-03-01). It begins, verbatim:

    Creative Commons Legal Code

    CC0 1.0 Universal

and its section 2 reads, in part: "Affirmer hereby overtly, fully, permanently,
irrevocably and unconditionally waives, abandons, and surrenders all of
Affirmer's Copyright and Related Rights and associated claims and causes of
action". GitHub identifies the file as CC0-1.0.

The scene's own main.glsl has no header comment. Other scenes in the same
repository carry the author's own header, for example
hyperlines.synScene/main.glsl: "This file is released under CC0 1.0 Universal
(Public Domain Dedication). To the extent possible under law, Mårten Rånge has
waived all copyright and related or neighboring rights to this work."

The code of this scene contains no third-party snippets and credits no other
author (its scene.json credit reads "mrange"). Other scenes in the repository
that do include third-party functions mark them with their own licence lines;
this one has none.

What was changed

- The Synesthesia wrapper and controls removed; controls fixed at their
  defaults; the audio input replaced by 0; the media layer dropped.
- The trail feedback buffer folded into a single pass by re-evaluating the
  last six frames of the original's 60 fps sequence for each pixel.
- The animation slowed to a quarter of the original's speed.
- GLSL translated to Metal Shading Language.
The full list is at the top of main.metal.

